And what are the major renewable energy resources\par
\par
Beyond solar, wind, hydro, and geothermal, several other key renewable energy resources round out the global clean energy matrix:\par
\par
Additional Major Renewable Energy Resources\par
Biomass & Bioenergy: Energy generated by combusting or processing organic matter (wood, agricultural waste, bagasse, and solid municipal waste). It can produce continuous heat, electricity, or liquid biofuels (ethanol, biodiesel).\par
\par
Advantage: Dispatchable power; directly replaces fossil fuels in existing combustion systems.\par
\par
Drawback: Low energy density; emits particulate matter and CO \par
